        "liquid": "<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n     \"Ready to furnish your home?\" CTA banner — light variant\n     Paste this whole block into a Custom Liquid / HTML section.\n     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n<style>\n  .ready-cta2 {\n    /* ── Smart Furniture palette ── */\n    --rc-navy: #002659;\n    --rc-coral: #ee7857;\n\n    /* ── Neutrals ── */\n    --rc-ink: #16181d;\n\n    /* ── Type ── */\n    --rc-font: inherit; /* set a stack here to override the theme font */\n\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    color: var(--rc-ink);\n    font-family: var(--rc-font);\n  }\n\n  /* The section stays flush; the inner wrapper carries all spacing. */\n  .ready-cta2__inner {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px);\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin-inline: auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px);\n    padding-block: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* ══ Copy ══ */\n  .ready-cta2__title {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .ready-cta2__accent {\n    color: var(--rc-coral);\n  }\n\n  /* ══ Actions ══ */\n  .ready-cta2__actions {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .ready-cta2__btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 13px 26px;\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition:\n      background-color 0.2s ease,\n      color 0.2s ease,\n      border-color 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .ready-cta2__btn:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--rc-navy);\n    outline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .ready-cta2__btn--primary {\n    border: 2px solid var(--rc-navy);\n    background: var(--rc-navy);\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n  .ready-cta2__btn--primary:hover {\n    background: #003d80;\n    border-color: #003d80;\n  }\n\n  .ready-cta2__btn--secondary {\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--rc-navy);\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--rc-navy);\n  }\n  .ready-cta2__btn--secondary:hover {\n    background: var(--rc-navy);\n    color: #fff;\n  }\n\n  /* ══ Responsive ══ */\n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n    .ready-cta2__inner {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n    }\n  }\n  @media screen and (max-width: 479px) {\n    /* Keep the two buttons side by side; equal columns, never stacked. */\n    .ready-cta2__actions {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n      align-items: stretch;\n      gap: 10px;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    .ready-cta2__btn {\n      padding-inline: 12px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.2;\n      text-align: center;\n      white-space: normal; /* let long labels wrap instead of overflowing */\n    }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .ready-cta2__btn {\n      transition: none;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"ready-cta2\" aria-label=\"Ready to furnish your home\">\n  <div class=\"ready-cta2__inner\">\n    <h2 class=\"ready-cta2__title\">\n      Ready to furnish your home?\n      <span class=\"ready-cta2__accent\">Start shopping today.</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <div class=\"ready-cta2__actions\">\n      <a class=\"ready-cta2__btn ready-cta2__btn--primary\" href=\"/collections/all\">\n        Shop All Products\n      </a>\n      <a\n        class=\"ready-cta2__btn ready-cta2__btn--secondary\"\n        href=\"/pages/contact-showrooms\"\n      >\n        Visit a Showroom\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
        "text_alignment": "center"
      }
    },
